OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe east will be mostly cloudy
OL,6,Fwith some outbreaks of light rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle possible. Further west will be
OL,8,Fdry with bright and sunny intervals
OL,9,Fdeveloping later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FLargely cloudy in the east at
OL,12,Ffirst with the odd spot of rain.
OL,13,FOtherwise dry with increasing clear
OL,14,Fspells developing, allowing areas of
OL,15,Ffog to form. Patchy rural frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
