OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA chilly start with fog in
OL,6,Fplaces. Otherwise mostly dry with
OL,7,Fvariable cloud and bright or sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Some showers around the east
OL,9,Fcoast. Frost and fog possible again
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,13,FTuesday with variable cloud and sunny
OL,14,Fspells. Bright spells and perhaps
OL,15,Fshowers on Wednesday. Colder but dry
OL,16,Fand sunnier on Thursday. Overnight
OL,17,Ffrost and fog possible under clearer
OL,18,Fskies.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
